    "title": "2 Michigan businesses and Flint church receive combined $60K in workforce transportation grants - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Advance Local Express Desk ,\n7 hours ago LANSING, MI – The Michigan Department of Labor and Economic Opportunity awarded $60,000 in grants to three businesses working to solve transportation barriers that prevent employees from getting to work reliably. Each organization received $20,000 through the Reliable Rides Incentive Grant Pilot Program to develop custom transportation solutions for... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
